{"id":203151047362096,"type":"artist","name":"10cc","artist":null,"year":1972,"weight":26,"info":{"country":"GB","begin":"1972","kind":"Group","similar":["Godley & Creme","Electric Light Orchestra","Al Stewart","Supertramp","Todd Rundgren","Wings","The Doobie Brothers","Pilot","Klaatu","Chicago"],"img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/10cc2010.jpg?width=500","bio":"10cc fue un grupo de estilo rock-pop y soft rock británico, originarios de Manchester. Se dice que su nombre se debe a que diez centímetros cúbicos es la cantidad promedio de semen que un hombre genera en cada eyaculación.\n\nSu debut fue en el año 1974 y la agrupación estuvo compuesta por Graham Gouldman, Eric Stewart, Kevin Godley y Lol Creme. Su gran éxito mundial llegó en 1975, con la canción I'm Not In Love; también son conocidas Silly Love, Wall Street Shuffle y Dreadlock Holiday. Se separaron en 1995.","tags":["classic rock","rock","70s","british","pop"]},"works":[{"id":158713174756470,"type":"album","name":"10cc","artist":"10cc","year":1973,"weight":3,"yt":"SOCClIk6hdM","src":"musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":199737804810861,"name":"RYM Top — Pop — Progressive Pop","rank":169,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":50431180996756,"type":"song","name":"Rubber Bullets","artist":"10cc","year":1973,"weight":2,"yt":"17GCBtKYaOg","src":"singles","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":176272515229071,"name":"UK nº1 · 1970s","rank":332,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":149318207955886,"type":"album","name":"Sheet Music","artist":"10cc","year":1974,"weight":6,"yt":"AJQhorrR5h4","src":"charts,musthear","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":192934750972716,"name":"1001 Albums You Must Hear Before You Die","rank":317,"scaruffi":null}],"n_lists":1}},{"id":5742581085515,"type":"song","name":"I'm Not in Love","artist":"10cc","year":1975,"weight":5,"yt":"STugQ0X1NoI","src":"charts,singles","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":75208713912